  "scope": "Native-image calibration. 2012 was fixed before collection and assessed only after validation choices were frozen. Training uses later years, so this is a retrospective held-out-year comparison, not a chronological hindcast. Best track may itself use satellite analysis; no independent aircraft accuracy claim. The fresh year is a promotion gate only; rejected candidates are not retuned on it. Resource-driven split changes, if any, are disclosed separately.",
  "promotion": "Each head must improve both frame and storm-balanced MAE without increasing RMSE, on 2020 native-component validation and then on the single untouched 2012 check. Otherwise SI-5 is retained for that head."
